    <sdc4-meta:isConstrainedByRmComponent rdf:resource="sdc4:XdLinkType"/>
    <rdfs:label>Business Registry Access Control</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Access control policy for business registration data using W3C Data Privacy Vocabulary. Enforces role-based access for registry clerks, business owners, and authorized agents. Governs dpv:CommercialData including registration documents, ownership records, and compliance filings.</rdfs:comment>
